msgid "Funqy HTTP Binding with Azure Functions"
msgstr "Vinculação HTTP do Funqy com o Azure Functions"

msgid ""
"You can use xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] on Azure Functions.  This allows you to invoke on multiple Funqy functions\n"
"using HTTP deployed as one Azure Function."
msgstr "Você pode usar o xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] no Azure Functions. Isso permite que você invoque múltiplas funções Funqy usando HTTP implantado como uma Função do Azure."

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "Essa tecnologia é considerada {extension-status}."

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr ""

msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "Para obter uma lista completa de possíveis status, consulte nosso https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ]."

msgid ""
"Follow the xref:azure-functions-http.adoc[Azure Functions HTTP Guide].  It walks through using a variety of HTTP\n"
"frameworks on Azure Functions.  Including Funqy."
msgstr "Siga o xref:azure-functions-http.adoc[Guia HTTP do Azure Functions] . Ele orienta o uso de uma variedade de frame HTTP no Azure Functions. Incluindo o Funqy."
